Package: EasyFlow2
Title: Streamlined Flow Cytometry Analysis Workflow
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Yantong", "Wan", email = "wytsmu@163.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides an end-to-end flow cytometry workflow for FCS preprocessing,
    interactive gating, dimensionality reduction, clustering, cell-type annotation,
    atlas projection, publication-ready visualization, abundance statistics,
    trajectory analysis, FCS export, and HTML reporting.
